# Chuan hoa ket thuc dong.
#
# Mac dinh: Git tu nhan dien file van ban va chuan hoa ve LF trong kho.
# eol=lf chu khong chi text=auto: text=auto de Git tu quyet dinh khi CHECKOUT.
# Voi core.autocrlf=true tren may Windows, cay lam viec ra CRLF trong khi
# prettier cua desktop-app doi LF — da gap that: hang tram canh bao "Delete CR"
# o nhung tep khong ai sua, du de nhan chim moi canh bao dinh dang co that.
# Ghim eol=lf de moi ban sao deu ra LF. Luu y: neu may nao dat
# core.autocrlf=true thi config do van thang thuoc tinh nay, phai dat
# core.autocrlf=input cho repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Script Windows BAT BUOC phai co ket thuc dong CRLF. Voi LF, cmd.exe phan tich
# sai va an mat vai ky tu dau moi dong — trieu chung la nhung dong bao loi kieu
# "'M' is not recognized as an internal or external command" (do "REM" bi cat
# thanh "M"). Day la loi that da gap khi kiem thu run-frontend.bat.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Script Unix thi nguoc lai: CRLF lam shell bao "bad interpreter".
*.sh  text eol=lf
mvnw  text eol=lf

# Khong dung cho file nhi phan.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
